  "description_short": "Family-friendly pub grub and hearty meals in a relaxed Great Brak River setting.",
  "description_long": "Searles Village sits comfortably in the heart of Great Brak River, serving as both neighbourhood pub and family restaurant. The menu covers reliable crowd-pleasers — think proper burgers, grills, and pub classics that work equally well for a family Sunday lunch or casual drinks with mates.\n\nThe atmosphere strikes that balance between laid-back local and welcoming to visitors passing through. With generous portions and consistent quality, it's the sort of place that draws regulars and road-trippers alike. The setting on Lang Street makes it an easy stop between Mossel Bay and George, with enough parking and a relaxed vibe that suits the Great Brak pace.\n\nWhether you're after a proper breakfast, weekday lunch, or evening meal with the family, Searles delivers without fuss. The pub side keeps things lively on weekends, while the restaurant area remains comfortably family-oriented throughout.",
